// Clue Name :
"P2076664066" "Ornate Metal Cube"
// DetailString :
"P3047035309" "This is an ornate cube made of a silvery-green metal which is cold to the touch. It looks like a puzzle box."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P21643518" "There is an enterprising mortal on St. Martial named Hardcase. He and I have come to an understanding and often exchange favors. I would like to deliver an item to him, and would like you to act as my emissary. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>Go to St. Martial and deliver this puzzle box to Hardcase</A>."
// AcceptString :
"P496714095" "Deliver puzzle box to Hardcase"
// SendOffString :
"P4014513474" "St. Martial is a dangerous place to the uninitiated.  While I can't guarantee your safety, I have concocted a Spirit Potion which will allow you to pass as an intangible entity through the more treacherous areas of St. Martial, unable to touch or be touched."
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1973600908" "You have not delivered the puzzle box to Hardcase yet. Make haste!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskBegin 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P425298497" "You have received a temporary power! "

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P1821133838" "Tarixus sent you? Damn, this puzzle box is an evil little thing. More evil than you can handle, {VillainName}.<br><br>You think you're bad? You don't know from bad. There are things of a more primal evil than you can ever imagine. Look me up next time you're in St. Martial and maybe I'll show you a few of them."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2040570039" "The puzzle box is delivered? Excellent. I am glad to get rid of the vile artifact..."
// RandomFameString :
